msgstr "Lagermotor"

#. translators: %s: comma-separated list of tables and their storage engines.
#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:842
msgid "These tables do not use InnoDB, so they miss row-level locking and crash recovery: %s"
msgstr "Disse tabeller bruger ikke InnoDB, så de mangler rækkeniveau-låsning og nedbrudsgenoprettelse: %s"

#: includes/class-minn-admin-db.php:845
